					<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
					<v8:content>Period = 2026-09-01, Company = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000, OnlyNew = true. The kind is inferred from the text. Values are put into the SQL as literals, which is what Power BI needs.</v8:content>
